# 3D source renders
# the originals are 4000-6000px pngs, around 400mb in total, and no page
# ever asks for them. the site only loads the resized copies in
# "portfolio/images/3d modelling/web", which are committed as normal.
# delete these three lines if you want the originals in the repo as well.
portfolio/images/3d modelling/*.png
portfolio/images/3d modelling/*/*.png
portfolio/images/3d modelling/*/*.meta

# source music
# the album folders are about 1.5gb of full length tracks. the site only
# ever serves the 30 second previews in portfolio/music/previews, which are
# committed as normal. everything else here stays local.
portfolio/music/*/
!portfolio/music/previews/

# claude outputs
# working files from claude code sessions, not part of the site
Claude outputs/
